## Technologies Used

1. HTML5
2. CSS3
3. JavaScript
4. Local Storage
5. Lucide Icons

## Features

### Client Features

- Client Login
- Client Registration
- Personal Dashboard
- Profile Management
- Project Tracking
- Document Center
- Document Download
- Support Ticket Creation
- Invoice Viewing
- Messaging System
- Dark Mode

### Admin Features

- Admin Login
- Admin Dashboard
- Client Management
- Add and Edit Clients
- Project Management
- Document Management
- Support Ticket Management
- Invoice Generation
- Payment Status Management

